    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Alex. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860494266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 52395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860498799999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860500799999
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. It's VF-8675-3091.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 52395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860505466665
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see the Urban Commuter Helmet, delivered on November 8th. Is that the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860507199998
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the one.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 52395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860515999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Looking at the delivery date, you are well within our 90-day return window. I can start that return for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860517199998
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh. You don't need a reason? The box is unopened. The color just isn't what I thought it would be.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 52395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860525733331
    },
    {
      "text": "No reason necessary when you're within the policy timeframe. We want you to be happy with your gear's style as well as its safety. I've gone ahead and approved the return for the helmet.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860532466664
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. I was expecting this to be a whole thing.",
