      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 52395,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860545066664
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. I've just sent a return shipping label to the email address on file. You can print that out, attach it to the package, and drop it off. Once we receive the item, your refund will be processed.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764860548399997
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Just make sure the refund actually shows up.",
